Looking for wedding rentals in Malaga? Malaga Event Gear provides the audio visual side of your day: PA sound for the ceremony and speeches, wireless microphones for vows, fairy light ambient lighting for the reception, and a live technician on site throughout, delivered, installed and tested by our own team.

Backed by experience going back to 1996, we build our [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) around what actually goes wrong at a wedding if nobody is watching it: a microphone that feeds back during the vows, or a sound system that doesn't reach the back row. A technician on site catches that before your guests notice.

Based in Malaga and serving events across the wider Costa del Sol, we cover the AV equipment. For anything outside sound, lighting, microphones and a technician, see [What We Stock, and What We Source](#what-we-stock-and-what-we-source) below.

## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear's [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) is our audio visual package for weddings: a high end active PA system for up to 80 guests, fairy light and warm LED ambient lighting, wireless microphones for vows and speeches, and a live technician on site for the whole event, all for 650 euros ex VAT. We deliver, install, test and collect the equipment ourselves, for both indoor venues and outdoor ceremonies across Malaga.

## Key Highlights

---

-   PA sound system for up to 80 guests, sized for a villa, finca or wedding hotel.
-   Fairy lights and warm LED strings for romantic ambient lighting, not a stage light rig.
-   Wireless microphones for vows, speeches and announcements.
-   A live technician on site throughout the event, one of only two packages in our catalog that includes one.
-   650 euros ex VAT, with delivery, setup and teardown included.

## What's Included in the Wedding Pack

The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) costs 650 euros, ex VAT, with Spain's 21 percent VAT added at checkout. It includes:

-   A high end active PA sound system for up to 80 guests.
-   Fairy lights and warm LED strings for ambient lighting.
-   Professional wireless microphones for speeches and announcements.
-   Transport in Malaga and surrounding areas.
-   Professional setup and cabling.
-   A live technician on site throughout the event.
-   Post event teardown and pickup.

See exact, live pricing and the full breakdown on our [packages page](/packages/).

