## Booking and Service Area

Our services cover Malaga, the Costa del Sol and Sevilla with no minimum order, and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros. There is no fixed booking window, only availability, so reach out once your date and venue are confirmed. Wedding dates fill up quickly, particularly in peak season.

## Conclusion

Whether it's a beach ceremony or a villa reception, Malaga Event Gear delivers the sound, lighting and technician your wedding day needs. For the full breakdown on pricing and what happens on the day, see our [audio visual rental for weddings](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-weddings/) guide. [Contact us](/contact/) to discuss your wedding.

## FAQs

### What's included in wedding rentals from Malaga Event Gear?

The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) includes a high end PA sound system for up to 80 guests, warm ambient lighting (fairy lights and LED strings), wireless microphones for vows and speeches, transport, professional setup, a live technician on site throughout the event, and post event teardown.

### How much do wedding rentals cost in Malaga?

The Wedding Pack costs 650 euros, ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout. The price includes delivery, setup and teardown. See exact pricing on our [packages page](/packages/).

### Is a technician included with wedding rentals?

Yes. The Wedding Pack includes a live technician on site throughout the event, one of only two packages in our catalog with a technician, alongside the MICE Pack, whose technician covers up to 6 continuous hours.

### How many guests can the Wedding Pack support?

Up to 80 guests, sized for a villa, finca or wedding hotel. For a larger wedding, [contact us](/contact/) to discuss options.

### Do wedding rentals include furniture, decor or photography?

No. The Wedding Pack covers sound, lighting, microphones and a technician. It does not include furniture, decor, dancefloor accessories, or photography and videography. See [What We Stock, and What We Source](#what-we-stock-and-what-we-source) above if your day needs one of them.

### How far in advance should I book wedding rentals?

There is no fixed booking window, only availability. Wedding dates fill up quickly, particularly in peak season, so reach out once your date and venue are confirmed.
